# Ignore large files
*.epub
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.gif
*.zip
*.mp4
*.avi

# Ignore OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Ignore downloaded data
*/下载/*
*/Downloads/*

# Ignore logs
*.log

# Ignore process backups / early demos (2026-09-17)
_datefix_backup_*/
_*_demo.html
_管理文档/数据看板_样式demo_*.html

# Ignore xhtml source tree (3.2 GB, protected by external-disk 源镜像 backup)
*/xhtml 文稿/

# Ignore source CSV tree (2026-09-21 方案A：源料下沉进演员目录)
#   理由：①源料是分页全批重导，进 git 只会产生巨大 diff 噪音
#         ②本仓库是 public，源料含详情页 URL 等全字段，不该上网
#   备份改走外置盘：skills/edge-batch-capture/scripts/backup_source_mirror.py
*/_源料/

# Keep CSV
!./**/*.csv
